        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia BTB-1970P, High End Back-To-Back Pull Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Back-to-Back High End Door Pull Set is a relatively thin, square pull perfect for adding a chic silhouette to any door. This modern High End Back-To-Back Pull Pair comes packaged as a set of 2 door pulls with the hardware to mount them back to back on a single door, Choose from a wide selection of contemporary finishes in either 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Packaged with 2 pulls</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia BTB-1970P Pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/high-end-modern-door-pull-omnia-1970p\"><b>Thru-Bolt Mounted Single Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 1970P Back-to-Back Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BTB-1970P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BTB-1970P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair with 2 door Pulls</i>\r\n</p>",
